step_details.raw_response:
Thought: Evaluate a simple best_single strategy using the strong seasonal model THETA to see if a single model can beat the mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"THETA"}

Thought: Test a robust median over the most stable subset (pool1) to see if median improves over mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a trimmed‑mean over the full pool to see if trimming helps robustness.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a robust median over the moderately stable pool2 to see if it improves over mean and trimmed_mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Test a DTW barycenter on the stable pool1 to see if it improves over mean/median.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool1","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a best_single strategy with FT_catboost to see if it outperforms THETA and mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"FT_catboost"}

Thought: Test a DTW barycenter on pool2 to see if it improves over best_single FT_catboost.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool2","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Try a robust median over the larger pool3 to see if it beats the current best_single FT_catboost.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool3"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using inverse_error on pool2 to see if weighting improves over mean and best_single.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","models":["DWT_rf","FT_rf","CWT_catboost","FT_catboost","ONLY_CWT_catboost","ONLY_CWT_rf"],"weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a trimmed‑mean over the most stable pool (pool4) to see if trimming the extremes improves over the best single FT_catboost.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool4","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Evaluate a DTW barycenter on pool4 to see if a different deterministic aggregator improves over current best.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool4","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a simple mean over pool4 to see if restricting to high‑correlation models improves over weighted or dba.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool4"}

